    "lite_evaluator_hardening_note": "Setup and cleanup remove each task-owned /tmp/code root rather than leaving stale directories behind. Interaction mode is Hybrid because the instruction names VSCode while the outcome-focused evaluator validates the native workspace settings file without claiming GUI-only provenance."
  }
}
